<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EDC started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EDC started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investments analysts Roberto d'Empaire and Eleanore Lefebure said they had started coverage of Venezuelan utility Electricidad de Caracas SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- In a February 6 analysis, they set a 12- to 18-month target price of $1.42 a share, implying a 39 percent rise from its current level.</p>
<p>-- EDC is the benchmark issue of the Caracas Stock Exchange and traded at 500.50 bolivares this morning, up five.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
